.TH "Docv::Roff::Registers" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Roff::Registers \- User number registers (\fB\%.nr\fR, \fB\%.af\fR, \fB\%.rr\fR, \fB\%.rnn\fR, \fB\%.aln\fR).
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Roff::Registers\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
User number registers (\fB\%.nr\fR, \fB\%.af\fR, \fB\%.rr\fR, \fB\%.rnn\fR, \fB\%.aln\fR).
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.render(value : Int64, format : String) : String\fR
Formats \fIvalue\fR per a \fB\%.af\fR format: \fB\%0\fR/\fB\%1\fR decimal (digits give the
minimum width), \fB\%i\fR/\fB\%I\fR roman, \fB\%a\fR/\fB\%A\fR alphabetic.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef []?(name : String) : Register | Nil\fR
The register \fIname\fR, if defined.
.PP
\fBdef alias(name : String, target : String) : Nil\fR
.PP
\fBdef delete(name : String) : Nil\fR
.PP
\fBdef format(name : String, format : String) : Nil\fR
.PP
\fBdef has_key?(name : String) : Bool\fR
.PP
\fBdef rename(from : String, to : String) : Nil\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef set(name : String, value : Int64, increment : Int64 | Nil = nil) : Nil\fR
Defines or sets \fIname\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef step(name : String, sign : Int32) : Int64\fR
Applies the auto\-increment of \fIname\fR (\fB\%\en+x\fR, \fB\%\en\-x\fR) and returns the
new value.
